 "_about": "Goldman Sachs samples captured 2026-10-19. (1) roleSearch: POST https://api-higher.gs.com/gateway/api/v1/graphql with the request body below; response = page 0 envelope (totalCount=891, pageSize=250) with items trimmed to 3 professional roles from page 0 + 4 Americas campus roles taken from later pages. (2) role-by-id: response of the site's own GetRoleById call made by https://higher.gs.com/roles/170705 (gives apply URL + descriptionHtml). (3) programs: first 3 of 25 entries of https://www.goldmansachs.com/feeds/programs-and-internships.json (program marketing pages, not requisitions).",
